cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DendroPivot in research or write about it, please cite:"
type: software
title: DendroPivot
abstract: >
  Privacy-first local web search explorer for Python. Grows a navigable
  knowledge tree from one query using multi-backend search and optional
  local Ollama LLM expansion. No API key required. Python standard library only.
url: https://github.com/TFD-42/dendropivot-search
repository-code: https://github.com/TFD-42/dendropivot-search
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-28"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - local web search
  - knowledge tree
  - exploratory search
  - privacy-first
  - ollama
  - python
  - no api key
  - query expansion
  - research tool
  - self-hosted
